uledDate":null,"emailSent":true}},"allowedSegmentIds":[],"isSpam":false,"displayed":true,"type":"changelog","date":"2025-12-08T17:07:17.768Z","reactions":{"💯":{"count":1,"users":["69b793a2419d7d14d3e1825c"]}},"id":"693705a68bc7f3794a86d7fd","slug":"november-updates-5","title":"November Updates","content":"<p>Quick update on what we've shipped recently.</p><p><strong>8 new bookmakers added:</strong></p><ul><li><p>STS PL</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"http://Tipsport.cz\">Tipsport.cz</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"http://Chance.sk\">Chance.sk</a></p></li><li><p>Vave</p></li><li><p>TonyBet</p></li><li><p>Ivibet</p></li><li><p>20Bet</p></li><li><p>Betano (reworked - much lower latency, previous bugs fixed)</p></li></ul><p><strong>New /participants endpoint:</strong> Get all teams and players with IDs to filter events more easily.</p><p><strong>Docs:</strong> https://docs.odds-api.io/api-reference/participants/get-participants</p><p>The /events endpoint now has a participantId field so you can filter by specific teams.</p><p><strong>Scores &amp; status improvements: </strong>We reworked the algorithm - much more accurate with very low latency now. Fixed the bug where some events weren't being marked as live or settled properly.</p><p><strong>WebSocket self-serve:</strong> You can now enable WebSocket directly at odds-api.io/manage without emailing us.</p><p><strong>Free plan launched: </strong>We also launched a free tier (2 bookmakers, 100 req/hour, no credit card) for anyone wanting to test the API before subscribing.</p>","state":"live","locale":"en","isDraftDiffersFromLive":false,"isPublished":true,"availableLocales":["en"],"publishedLocales":["en"],"slugs":{"en":"november-updates-5"}},{"changelogCategories":[],"commentCount":0,"organization":"oddsapi","notifications":{"en":{"sendEmailNotification":true,"hideFromBoardAndWidgets":false,"s